    Trapped elf, Fox, Colored pens,
    Dinosaur model, Dark King''s door, Altar puzzle effects (correct/wrong)

    Toolbox,
    Merchant''s stall, Cards, Paper, Bread, Piano, Chef, Book page chest, Magic circle

    License:
    CC Attribution / CC BY-NC


    [Sound Effects]

    Game Sound Factory - most
    sound effects

    Freesound - Monster Roar (CC BY 4.0), Plors - crying (CC0)

    License:
    Non-Commercial / CC BY / CC0'
